    "body": "Hi @zapman449, Unfortunately I'm unable to reproduce the issue as far as I can see it works as expected.\r\n\r\n```\r\n❯ kubectl config current-context \r\narn:aws:eks:us-east-1:999999999999:cluster/prod-green\r\n\r\n☸ prod-green-east in ~ \r\n❯ cat ~/.config/starship.toml\r\n...\r\n\r\n[kubernetes]\r\ndisabled = false\r\n\r\n[kubernetes.context_aliases]\r\n\"arn:aws:eks:us-east-1:999999999999:cluster/prod-green\" = \"prod-green-east\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nCan you try running `RUST_LOG=starship=trace starship module kubernetes` and post the results here?",
