    "body": "AHH.  Found the problem:\r\n\r\n```\r\n[kubernetes.context_aliases]\r\n\"arn:aws:eks:us-east-1:999999999999:cluster/prod-green\" = \"prod-green-east\"\r\n\"arn:aws:eks:us-west-2:999999999999:cluster/prod-green\" = \"prod-green-west\"\r\n\"arn:aws:eks:us-west-2:666666666666:cluster/staging-green\" = \"staging-green-west\"\r\n\"arn:aws:eks:us-west-2:111111111111:cluster/dev-green\" = \"dev-green-west\r\n```\r\n\r\nI was missing a trailing double quote on the last line.\r\n\r\nThat resulted in these relevant trace lines:\r\n\r\n```\r\n...\r\n TRACE starship::config > No config found for \"kubernetes\"\r\n...\r\n TRACE starship::config             > No config found for \"kubernetes\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nWhich is interesting.\r\n\r\nI'm going to close this, but a \"config validation\" method might be useful to expose to the user since this module just silently fails on erroneous config.",
